<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Order Invoice</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <h2 style="color: #4CAF50; text-align: center;">🎉 Order Update - JCS Trading</h2>
        <p>Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for shopping with us. Here is the update for your order:</p>
        
        <div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Order ID:</strong> <%= orderId %></p>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Order Status:</strong> <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;"><%= status %></span></p>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Total Price:</strong> BDT <%= totalPrice %></p>
            <!-- <% if (trackingId) { %>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Courier:</strong> <%= courierName %></p>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Tracking ID:</strong> <%= trackingId %></p>
            <% } %> -->
        </div>

        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.</p>
        <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777777; text-align: center;">This is an automated email from JCS Trading. Please do not reply directly to this message.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>